The ladies in hair and makeup really must have hit that curling iron hard.
负责发型和化妆的女士们肯定在卷发棒上下足了功夫。

801
00:35:18.570 --> 00:35:19.970
Wait, Jenna, I have to show it to you.
等等，珍娜，我得给你看个东西。

802
00:35:20.070 --> 00:35:20.770
You have to see.
你一定要看。

803
00:35:20.910 --> 00:35:22.650
This is a, what should we call this?
这是个，我们该叫它什么呢？

804
00:35:23.050 --> 00:35:24.750
Poofy Kevin hair alert?
凯文的蓬蓬头警报？

805
00:35:25.350 --> 00:35:25.910
Okay.
好吧。

806
00:35:26.530 --> 00:35:26.970
Okay.
好吧。

807
00:35:27.890 --> 00:35:28.330
Wow.
哇。

